<title>GEORGIA: SOCCER-GEORGIA BEAT MOLDOVA 1-0 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 GAME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GEORGIA BEAT MOLDOVA 1-0 IN EUROPEAN UNDER-21 GAME.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia beat Moldova 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in their European under-21 championship group two</p>
<p>qualifying match in Poti on Friday:</p>
<p>Scorer: Georgy Demetradze, 49 (pen)</p>
<p>    Standings	    P  W  D  L  F   A Pts</p>
<p> 1. England		6  3  3  0  5   1  12</p>
<p> 2. Italy		  6  3  2  1 17   3  11</p>
<p> 3. Poland		 5  0  4  1  4   6   4</p>
<p> 4. Georgia		4  1  1  2  1   7   4</p>
<p> 5. Moldova		5  1  0  4  3  13   3</p>
</text>
